===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/daɪˈɹɛk.tɪv/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/daI"rEk.tIv/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An [[instruction]] or [[guideline]] that indicates how to [[perform]] an action or [[reach]] a [[goal]].
# An [[authoritative]] [[decision]] from an official [[body]], which may or may not have [[bind]]ing [[force]].
# {{context|European Union law}} A form of [[legislative]] [[act]] addressed to the Member States. The directive binds the Member State to reach certain objectives in their national legislation.
# The [[directive case]].

